        "@value": "Participants will learn songs, scenes, and dances with Andrew Morrisey, an actor, singer and teacher originally from Truro, NS, now based in New York City. We are delighted to have Andrew back to Annapolis Royal for the 5th Summer with his incredibly popular camp!"
      }
