        "@value": "<div dir='auto'><strong>You are invited to an evening of Music &amp; Friends for Cats<br /> </strong></div> <div dir='auto'></div> <div dir='auto'><strong>A Fundraiser for the Cats for Keeps Rescue Society</strong></div> <p><strong>Featuring:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>NOELLE LUCAS with PAUL PURCELL &amp; LIZ RHYMER<br /> </strong></li> <li><strong>TYLER SALSMAN</strong></li> <li><strong>AUTUMN DEDRICK</strong></li> <li><strong>AL DUPUIS</strong></li> <li><strong>LYNNEA ROSE PATTERSON</strong></li> </ul> <div> <p><strong>TICKETS: </strong><strong>$26.00</strong></p> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p><strong>Reserve your tickets online or at the Box Office.</strong></p> <p>Tickets: boxoffice@kingstheatre.ca or 902-532-7704.</p> <p><strong>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.<br /> </strong></p> <p><small><a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'><b>Click here for King’s Ticket Exchange policies</b></a></small></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div></div> <div></div> <div></div> <div></div> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
    ],
