        "@value": "MUSIC & FRIENDS FOR CATS"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n                You are invited to an evening of Music & Friends for Cats\n\n\nA Fundraiser for the Cats for Keeps Rescue Society\nFeaturing:\n\nNOELLE LUCAS with PAUL PURCELL & LIZ RHYMER\n\nTYLER SALSMAN\nAUTUMN DEDRICK\nAL DUPUIS\nLYNNEA ROSE PATTERSON\n\n\nTICKETS: $26.00\n\n\n\nReserve your tickets online or at the Box Office.\nTickets: boxoffice@kingstheatre.ca or 902-532-7704.\nDoors open 45 minutes before showtime.\n\nClick here for King’s Ticket Exchange policies\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n            "
      }
    ],
