        "@value": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Tong-Wang-recital-1000.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2026-2-8T14:00-3:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2026-2-8T23:59-3:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TONG WANG"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n                Thrilling Canadian pianist Tong Wang is a dynamic artist whose work spans styles, genres, and communities. A prizewinner of the International Chopin Golden Ring Competition and recipient of the Queen’s Golden Jubilee Medal of Performing Arts, she has performed with the Edmonton and Red Deer Symphony Orchestras, toured internationally, and brought music to schools, senior homes, and hospitals.Beyond the stage, Tong is deeply engaged in social and cultural initiatives. She has led multimedia projects, co-founded innovative ensembles, and launched the Windwood Music Festival to bring chamber music into rural communities. Her creative performances often weave together music, storytelling, and visual art to explore themes of identity, culture, and connection.\n\n\nTICKETS:  \n\nAdults: $30 \nYouth: $10\nHST Additional\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDoors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.\nKing’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.\nTickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.\nAll persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.\nOutside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.\nFor more information about Theatre policies, click here.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n            "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
