        "@value": "THE SKELETON DANCE - King&#039;s Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Skeleton Dance is a highly physical, energetic, and light-hearted play with elements of clown and puppetry. Created and performed by Emma James (they/she) and Ella MacDonald (she/her), it  is a an all ages about death. "
      }
    ],
