    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GIRLS NITE OUT"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><em>Returning to King&#8217;s Theatre with another </em>hilarious night of comedy and improv,<i><strong> Girls Nite Out</strong> is</i> the all-female, all funny comedy extravaganza starring some of Canada’s best comedians &#8212; including the extraordinary ELVIRA KURT &#8212; for one night only!</p> <p>Skillful standup and improv created from audience suggestions mean that no two shows are the same. The talented comics are Canadian Comedy Award Winners, CBC darlings and Second City alums, including Elvira Kurt, Jennine Profeta, Diana Frances, Karen Parker, and Jordan Armstrong.</p> <p>Laugh your heart out as they re-imagine daily routines and weave in just the right touch of absurdity, often set to catchy, off-the-cuff tunes. This will be a night of original comedy that you’ll never forget!</p> <div id='i8e4vmc5' class='BaOVQ8 tz5f0K i8e4vmc5 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <p><strong>ALL TICKETS:</strong><strong>  </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $45 </strong></li> <li><strong>Supported: $25</strong></li> <li>HST additional</li> </ul> <p><em><strong>* Intended for mature audiences.</strong></em></p> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><iframe title='Girls Nite Out 2025/26 Promo' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/FE3rfpJEEZM?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <div style='position: relative; padding-top: max(60%,326px); height: 0; width: 100%;'><iframe style='position: absolute; border: none; width: 100%; height: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;' src='https://e.issuu.com/embed.html?d=girls_nite_out_program_-_02-27-26&amp;u=kingstheatreannapolisroyal' sandbox='allow-top-navigation allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation allow-downloads allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-modals allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-forms' allowfullscreen='allowfullscreen'></iframe></div> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
    ],
