    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GIRLS NITE OUT"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n                Returning to King’s Theatre with another hilarious night of comedy and improv, Girls Nite Out is the all-female, all funny comedy extravaganza starring some of Canada’s best comedians — including the extraordinary ELVIRA KURT — for one night only!\nSkillful standup and improv created from audience suggestions mean that no two shows are the same. The talented comics are Canadian Comedy Award Winners, CBC darlings and Second City alums, including Elvira Kurt, Jennine Profeta, Diana Frances, Karen Parker, and Jordan Armstrong.\nLaugh your heart out as they re-imagine daily routines and weave in just the right touch of absurdity, often set to catchy, off-the-cuff tunes. This will be a night of original comedy that you’ll never forget!\n\nALL TICKETS:  \n\nAdults: $45 \nSupported: $25\nHST additional\n\n* Intended for mature audiences.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDoors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.\nKing’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.\nTickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.\nAll persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.\nOutside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.\nFor more information about Theatre policies, click here.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n            "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
