        "@value": "JOYRIDE - King's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Buckle up for JoyRide, a duo that is a fast-paced, multi-instrumental thrill-ride  of jazz, ragtime, Latin, klezmer, Celtic, bebop, blues and more! Colin Maier (oboe, saw, vocals, from Quartetto Gelato) & Mark Camilleri (pianist and music director for The Tenors) are JoyRide."
      }
    ],
