        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span class='x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xlh3980 xvmahel x1n0sxbx x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u' dir='auto'><span class='x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xlh3980 xvmahel x1n0sxbx x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u'><span class='html-span xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs'>The Sparkle Dance Academy returns with their dynamic Spring Showcase: &#8220;Pirates, Vikings and The Great Treasure&#8221;</span></span></span></p> <p><strong>Saturday May 9 at 2pm &amp; 6pm</strong></p> <p>Come discover the power of 90+ Sparkle Dancers on stage!</p> <div class='elementor-element elementor-element-ecfc7f8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading' data-id='ecfc7f8' data-element_type='widget' data-widget_type='heading.default'> <div class='elementor-widget-container'> <p class='elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default'><strong>Wendy Goudie &#8211; Sparkle Dance Director:</strong> Wendy Goudie is an award-winning dancer and choreographer renowned for fostering community, confidence and collaboration through dance.</p> <div class='elementor-element elementor-element-623c753 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading' data-id='623c753' data-element_type='widget' data-widget_type='heading.default'> <div class='elementor-widget-container'> <p class='elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default'><strong>John Goudie &#8211; DJ Sparkle &amp; Creative Arts Producer:</strong> John Goudie creates the behind-the-scenes magic at Sparkle Dance.  From producing our inspiring music to deejaying our special events, John brings Sparkle Dance performances to life!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $20 for one show / $35 for two shows</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth (Under 18): $5 for one show / $8 for two shows </strong></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <div class='TitleB