    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/BarraMacNeils-promo-2021-1-1.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "THE BARRA MACNEILS"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class='grid home-intro'> <div class='content'> <p><strong>Canada’s Celtic ambassadors return to King&#8217;s Theatre!</strong></p> <p>For four decades, Cape Breton-based family group the Barra MacNeils has been thrilling audiences of all ages, near and far, with their sparkling repertoire, vocals, instrumental prowess and vibrant showmanship.</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>Kyle</strong> (vocals, guitar, violin, mandolin), <strong>Lucy</strong> (vocals, bodhran, Celtic harp, fiddle, stepdancing), <strong>Sheumas</strong> (keyboards, piano, bodhran, fiddle, bouzouki, vocals), <strong>Stewart</strong> (vocals, accordion, tin whistle, flute, bouzouki, guitar, stepdancing), <strong>Boyd</strong> (mandolin, fiddle, guitar, banjo, percussion, stepdancing) and <strong>Jamie Gatti</strong> (bass).</p> <div id='i8e4vmc5' class='BaOVQ8 tz5f0K i8e4vmc5 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong><strong>  </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $60</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth: $20</strong></li> <li>HST Additional</li> </ul> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
    ],
