        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/event_242544_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/pillow-fite/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/pillow-fite-banner.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "PILLOW FITE"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Celebrate Annapolis Royal Pride with alt-pop band <strong>Pillow Fite, </strong>plus singer-songerwriters <strong>Stewart Legere,</strong> and<strong> Freya Milliken.</strong></p> <p><strong>Pillow Fite</strong> first appeared in a glitter bomb of enthusiastic feelings, an acoustic guitar duo given to constant queer longing and occasional full-band outings. Across a handful of singles and their first EP, <em>Flutter</em>, Art Ross (they/them/Pisces) and Aaron Green (he/him/Virgo) combined their respective gifts of reflection and melody for moody, slow-burning indie-folk aimed straight at the heart.</p> <p><strong>Stewart Legere</strong> is a queer multidisciplinary artist from Halifax/Kji’puktuk. He is a vocalist with orchestral pop outfit The Heavy Blinkers. In 2017 he released his debut solo album <em>Quiet The Station </em>and composes for theatre and film. He makes live performances (mostly) with Zuppa Theatre Co. and The Accidental Mechanics Group. An avid and passionate collaborator, his work is fascinated with sexuality, vulnerability, intimacy, the destruction of persona and the celebration of performance.</p> <p class='preFade fadeIn'><strong>Freya Milliken</strong> is an award-winning singer-songwriter whose music resonates with warmth, authenticity and introspection. Known for her rich, velvety voice and dynamic blend of indie-folk and rock influences, Freya&#8217;s music will take you through an evocative journey of self-discovery and reflection, with a gentle yet powerful lure into an intimate and heartfelt realm.</p> <div id='i8e4vmc5' class='BaOVQ8 tz5f0K i8e4vmc5 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong><strong>  </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $30</strong></li> <li><strong>Supported: $20</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth: $10</strong></li> <li>HST Additional</li> </ul> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><iframe title='Ativan - Pillow Fite' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/ejYLbxb-IOk?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <p><iframe title='THE BIG SING - &quot;Our Love&quot; Stewart Legere' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/et-LGkopQ2s?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><iframe title='Freya Milliken - &quot;Wholeheartedly&quot; Live at ECMA 2024' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/aZPa0g9OyTs?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
    ],
