  {
    "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/event_242733_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/dance-camp-for-youth/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Screenshot-2026-02-23-at-12.09.56-PM.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DANCE CAMP FOR YOUTH"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong><span class='kma42e'>The costumes, the music, the props&#8230;. The show experience is powerful!<br /> 5 days of creation and rehearsal, followed by a show on stage for the community.</span></strong></p> <ul> <li><span class='kma42e'>July 27 &#8211; 31</span></li> <li><span class='kma42e'>Monday &#8211; Friday 10am &#8211; 2pm</span></li> <li><span class='kma42e'>Ages 7-12</span></li> </ul> <p><span class='kma42e'>Participants will spend an exciting week pushing their dancing to the limit, to learn and co-create their own original dance show.</span></p> <p>Dance styles include bellydance, bhangra, bollywood, flamenco, salsa, hip hop, break dance, jazz, ballet and more.</p> <p>This week is a creativity &amp; confidence booster!  Campers will work as a team to create and rehearse a full show in 5 days, manage lightening-quick costume changes, and how to &#8216;run the show&#8217; backstage.</p> <p><em><strong>There will be a performance for the community on Friday July 31 at 2pm at Kings Theatre.</strong></em></p> <p><strong>What to bring each day:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Lunch, snacks and beverages for the day;</li> <li>Clean indoor footwear.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Instructor: WENDY GOUDIE</strong></p> <p><strong>COST: $200+ hst </strong></p> <p><em><strong>Space is limited. Registration required.</strong></em></p> "
      }
    ],
