  {
    "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/event_242480_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/tamar-ilana-ventanas/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Screenshot-2025-12-10-at-12.34.06-PM.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TAMAR ILANA + VENTANAS"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4 class='preFade fadeIn'>Women-led Flamenco Mediterranean Fusion</h4> <p class='preFade fadeIn'>Tamar Ilana &amp; Ventanas is a 6-piece global music and flamenco band based in Toronto, Canada. Founded in 2011 by &#8220;powerhouse vocalist&#8221; (Downbeat Magazine) and Jewish-Indigenous artist Tamar Ilana, they&#8217;ve received 4 CFMA nominations, and toured across Canada, the US, Colombia, Portugal, Ireland and Spain. They released their 4th album, AZADI, in 2024: original compositions that reflect on life’s freedoms with strong influences from their unique combination of cultural and musical backgrounds including Flamenco, Sephardic, Balkan, Greek, Turkish, Jazz, Pop, Classical and Mediterranean folk.</p> <p><iframe title='Tamar Ilana &amp; Ventanas: TOWARD THE LIGHT (Am Ne&#039;emanay)' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/3zw6FuAkpJs?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <div id='i8e4vmc5' class='BaOVQ8 tz5f0K i8e4vmc5 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong><strong>  </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $45</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth/Supported: $20</strong></li> <li>HST Additional</li> </ul> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
    ],
