    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GYPSY"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='comp-kx969csw3' class='KcpHeO tz5f0K comp-kx969csw3 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <div class='elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-188a402' data-id='188a402' data-element_type='column'> <div class='elementor-column-wrap elementor-element-populated'> <div class='elementor-widget-wrap'> <div class='elementor-element elementor-element-db5b06d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor' data-id='db5b06d' data-element_type='widget' data-widget_type='text-editor.default'> <div class='elementor-widget-container'> <div> <p>The Premiere Fleetwood Mac Tribute Band features accomplished musicians, returns to King&#8217;s Theatre with their world-class show! The songs of this iconic recording artist transcend across three generations of music fans. Their award-winning album called’ Rumours” has sold close to 50 million copies. Fleetwood Mac has reached international acclaim with countless Billboard charting smash hits.</p> <p>The “Gypsy” Fleetwood Mac experience is a truly authentic representation of this multiple award-winning groups very best songs of all time, including Stevie Nicks duets with Don Henley and Tom Petty. Their spectacular show repertoire includes; “Dreams, Go your Own Way, Rhiannon, Don’t Stop, The Chain,” and many more fan favourites.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>TICKETS: </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>$45 Adults</strong></li> <li><strong>$10 Youth<br /> </strong></li> </ul> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p><em>HST additional</em></p> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'></div> </div> </div> </div> "
