    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "JACKSON-WILSON QUARTET"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class='image-title-wrapper'> <div class='image-title sqs-dynamic-text' data-width-percentage='31.5'> <div class='et_pb_row et_pb_row_5'> <div class='et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child'> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'> <div class='et_pb_text_inner'> <div class='et_pb_row et_pb_row_5'> <div class='et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child'> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'> <div class='et_pb_text_inner'> <div class='et_pb_row et_pb_row_5'> <div class='et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child'> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'><strong>Jackson/Wilson Quartet</strong> is the combined forces of Juno Award winning trombonist Andrew Jackson, and Four time Music Nova Scotia award- winning guitarist Sam Wilson. Together they have been exploring the interplay of trombone and guitar, honing their musical chemistry since 2014.</div> <div></div> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'>At the time of their meeting, both musicians were searching for a setting to explore jazz in a less traditional format, and they quickly realized they were on a similar musical discovery. Over the past decade, this has led them to develop a common musical language, creating an original sound that is contemporary, thoughtful, and fresh. Their 2023 album “New Doors” received critical acclaim, and since the release, the two have had the opportunity to tour across the country.</div> <div></div> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'>Joined by bassist Gabriella Ciurcovich, and drummer Caito MacDonald, audiences can expect a wide variety of sounds, from original music, jazz classics, and familiar pop hits.</div> </div> </div> <div class='et_pb_row et_pb_row_7'> <div class='et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_9 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child'> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'> <div class='et_pb_text_inner'> <p><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mEGWDuHN2LM'>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mEGWDuHN2LM</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $30</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth (Under 18): $10</strong><br /> <em>HST additional.</em></li> </ul> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id='block-yui_3_17_2_1_1705610041133_55787' class='sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html' data-block-type='2' data-border-radii='{&quot;topLeft&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0},&quot;topRight&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0},&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0},&quot;bottomRight&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0}}' data-sqsp-block='text'> <div class='sqs-block-content'> <div class='sqs-html-content' data-sqsp-text-block-content=''> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> <div id='block-yui_3_17_2_1_1685838155455_113907' class='sqs-block horizontalrule-block sqs-block-horizontalrule' data-block-type='47'> <div class='sqs-block-content'></div> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> "
