  {
    "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/event_242677_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/mysteries-of-the-keyhole-house/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Event-Page-3.webp"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MYSTERIES OF THE KEYHOLE HOUSE"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class='elementor-element elementor-element-139be64 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor' data-id='139be64' data-element_type='widget' data-widget_type='text-editor.default'> <div class='elementor-widget-container'> <div class='elementor-element elementor-element-8a2f314 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading' data-id='8a2f314' data-element_type='widget' data-widget_type='heading.default'> <div class='elementor-widget-container'> <h2 class='elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default'><strong>Experience the Magic</strong></h2> </div> </div> <div class='elementor-element elementor-element-e75ef31 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor' data-id='e75ef31' data-element_type='widget' data-widget_type='text-editor.default'> <div class='elementor-widget-container'> <p>What happens when two of Canada’s master illusionists move into a century-old house, that’s rumoured to be haunted?</p> <p>Join Ted and Marion Outerbridge – fresh from mesmerizing audiences at Hollywood’s Magic Castle – as they blend their family friendly illusions with a spine-tingling true tale that’s captivated over 30 million viewers worldwide.</p> <p>This isn’t just another magic show.</p> <p>It’s an unforgettable journey into the unexplained, where every illusion adds to the mystery, and unlocking secrets only leads to deeper questions.</p> <p>As seen on CTV National News, CBC, TVO, and The Golf Channel.</p> <p>The hallmarks of Outerbridge performances include cutting-edge theatrical illusion, world class dance, and high energy magical adventure alongside a compelling narrative, that will leave the entire family spellbound.</p> <p><strong>OUTERBRIDGE MAGIC | Mysteries of the Keyhole House</strong> is meant to entertain and be enjoyed by the entire family. That being said, it does contain loud noises, some moments of darkness, and a friendly ghost.<strong> It is recommended for ages 6 and up.</strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><iframe title='Outerbridge Magic - Mysteries of the Keyhole House - Official Trailer' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/dW1Ka-bCX3w?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $40</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth (Under 18): $20</strong> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'>HST Additional</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </li> </ul> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> "
      }
