  {
    "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/event_242689_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/geoff-arsenault/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/d759fc_f1e82be987c343cfa4b18e2b46249d2bmv2.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GEOFF ARSENAULT"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class='et_pb_row et_pb_row_5'> <div class='et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child'> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'> <div class='et_pb_text_inner'> <div class='et_pb_row et_pb_row_5'> <div class='et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child'> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'> <div class='et_pb_text_inner'> <div class='et_pb_row et_pb_row_5'> <div class='et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child'> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'> <div class='et_pb_text_inner'> <p><strong>A night of blues with Geoff Arsenault on vocals &amp; guitar and Glenn Patscha on keys.</strong></p> <p>Geoff Arsenault is a multi award winning, veteran, touring and recording artist. Based in the East of Canada, his unique style and skill behind the drum kit has taken him clear across North America, all through Europe, and the UK.</p> <p>He has three ‘solo recordings’ to his name: This Ain’t No Fiction [2006], Voodoo Baby Rattle [2011], and Hired Hand [2025].</p> <p>Geoff’s music sits somewhere between ‘Tony Joe White and ‘J.J. Cale’ – <em>a real swampy, blues roots music style, tinged with a pinch of Tex-Mex, and a dash of New Orleans blues.</em></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class='et_pb_row et_pb_row_6'> <div class='et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_7 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child'> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'> <div class='et_pb_text_inner'></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class='et_pb_row et_pb_row_7'> <div class='et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_9 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child'> <div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'> <div class='et_pb_text_inner'></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $30</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth (Under 18): $10</strong> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'></div> </li> </ul> <p><iframe title='Hidebound (I Ain&#039;t Locked Down) - Geoff Arsenault' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/6m8RhHHzK1M?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> "
      }
