  {
    "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kings-theatre-welcome/event_242510_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/stories-that-move/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/meredith-wendy-sara.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kings-theatre-welcome/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "STORIES THAT MOVE"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong>Stories That Move</strong></p> <p><em>Soft, heartfelt — the gift of story and a</em> <em>dancer’s tribute.</em></p> <p>Wendy Goudie, Sparkle Dancers, and special guests Meredith Kalaman and Sara Hartland-Rowe</p> <p>Residents at Digby&#8217;s Tideview Terrace Long-term Care Home have been matched with Sparkle Dancers. Each pair has spent time together, with dancers interviewing their paired resident. Hours of conversation about life, memories, choices, troubles and celebrations have been shared by residents and documented by dancers. The youth have then been guided to self choreograph a tribute to their partner. Capturing part of life&#8217;s story in a dance, dedicating a moment, and celebrating legacy, these are original choreographies, performed from the heart. Come and feel the power of inter-generational connection!</p> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $25</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth: $5 (Under 18)</strong></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</li> <li>Please no outside food or beverage.</li> <li>Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian. No babes in arms.</li> <li><small><b><small><a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>No refunds. Click here for King’s Ticket Exchange policies</a></small></b></small></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> <p><iframe title='STORIES THAT MOVE- LIVE DANCE AT KING’S!' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/bxYojnuARqM?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> "
      }
    ],
