    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Luca-Banner-scaled-1.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Luca"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='movie-details-expander'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='ipc-metadata-list-item__content-container'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base sc-ac2b5e16-0 deDizX' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='cpx-bottomMargin-lg'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_container__ftjgX'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_detailsContainer__2seki'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_ctaAndDetails__BpCFb'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_genreContainer__qEtwh MovieSelectedDetails_movieDetail__8XtgT'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <h6 class='drawer'>FREE EASTER FILM</h6> <div class='drawer'>Set in a beautiful seaside town on the Italian Riviera, Disney and Pixar&#8217;s original feature film &#8220;Luca&#8221; is a coming-of-age story about one young boy experiencing an unforgettable summer filled with gelato, pasta and endless scooter rides. Luca (voice of Jacob Tremblay) shares these adventures with his newfound best friend, Alberto (voice of Jack Dylan Grazer), but all the fun is threatened by a deeply-held secret: they are sea monsters from another world just below the water&#8217;s surface.</div> <div></div> </div> <div><img class='alignnone size-medium wp-image-242587' src='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Luca-Ratings-300x78.png' alt='' width='300' height='78' /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <ul> <li><strong>Stars: </strong>Jacob Tremblay, Jack Dylan Grazer, Emma Berman</li> <li><strong><strong>Director: </strong></strong>Enrico Casarosa</li> <li><strong><strong>Writers: </strong></strong>Enrico Casarosa, Jesse Andrews, Simon Stephenson</li> </ul> <p><strong>Genre:</strong> Drama<br /> <strong>Duration:</strong> 1<span class='cpx-body' data-testid='movie-length'>h 35m</span><br /> <strong>Rating:</strong> PG</p> <h3 style='text-align: center;'><strong>FREE! GENERAL SEATING AT THE DOOR</strong></h3> <ul class='p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested' data-stringify-type='ordered-list' data-list-tree='true' data-indent='0' data-border='0'> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em> Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> <p><iframe title='LUCA Trailer 2 (New, 2021) Disney Pixar Movie HD' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/qqNiX-ikPGI?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> "
