    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/hoppers/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Copy-of-KT-Save-the-Date-2026-Holiday-Auction-Banner.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Hoppers"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='movie-details-expander'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='ipc-metadata-list-item__content-container'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base sc-ac2b5e16-0 deDizX' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='cpx-bottomMargin-lg'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_container__ftjgX'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_detailsContainer__2seki'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_ctaAndDetails__BpCFb'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_genreContainer__qEtwh MovieSelectedDetails_movieDetail__8XtgT'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <p>What if you could talk to animals and understand what they&#8217;re saying? In Disney and Pixar&#8217;s all-new feature film &#8220;Hoppers,&#8221; scientists have discovered how to &#8220;hop&#8221; human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals! The adventure introduces Mabel, an animal lover who seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world that are beyond anything she could have imagined.</p> <div></div> </div> </div> <div><img class='alignnone wp-image-242796 size-medium' src='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Screenshot-2026-03-18-at-5.24.45-PM-300x75.png' alt='' width='300' height='75' /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <ul> <li><strong>Stars: </strong>Piper Curda, Bobby Moynihan, Jon Hamm</li> <li><strong><strong>Director: </strong></strong>Daniel Chong</li> <li><strong><strong>Writers: </strong></strong>Daniel Chong, Jesse Andrews, Jordan Harrison</li> </ul> <p><strong>Genre:</strong>  Animation, Comedy,<br /> <strong>Duration:</strong> 1<span class='cpx-body' data-testid='movie-length'>h 46m</span><br /> <strong>Rating:</strong> G</p> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong><br /> <strong>$11.95 Adult</strong><br /> <strong>$7.95 Youth (under 18)</strong><br /> (HST additional)</p> <ul class='p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested' data-stringify-type='ordered-list' data-list-tree='true' data-indent='0' data-border='0'> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </div> <p><iframe title='Hoppers | Official Trailer' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/PypDSyIRRSs?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> "
      }
