  {
    "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/category/uncategorized/event_242319_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/epic-eagles-3/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/epic-eagles-logo-25-on-desert-wht-epic-1500-x-1500-px.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EPIC EAGLES"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span lang='EN-US'><strong>EPIC EAGLES &#8212; The Definitive Eagles Tribute &#8212; return to King&#8217;s Theatre for a third time!</strong></span></p> <p><span lang='EN-US'>Providing a masterful presentation of Eagles classic hits and Don Henley favourites with its rock n’ roll game-changing song catalogue, </span><i><span lang='EN-US'><strong>Epic Eagles</strong></span></i><span lang='EN-US'> has earned its place among the top drawing tribute acts in North America and is widely regarded as the finest Eagles tribute show in production today. </span><span lang='EN-US'>Perfecting the music while sharing incredible lead vocal similarity, audiences are treated to a high energy show with the legacy sound of the Eagles and Don Henley. </span></p> <p><span lang='EN-US'>The show features greatest hits like </span><i><span lang='EN-US'>Hotel California, One of These Nights, Life in the Fast Lane, Desperado, Dirty Laundry, New Kid in Town, Take it Easy, The Boys of Summer</span></i><span lang='EN-US'> along with some deep cuts for the die-hard Eagles &amp; Henley fans. </span><span lang='EN-US'>Journey through all the Eagles’ signature sounds, from country rock to hard rocking tunes highlighting their extraordinary catalogue, with lush vocal harmonies and exceptional musical accuracy. </span></p> <p><strong>TICKETS: </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>$45 Adults</strong></li> <li><strong>$15 Youth<br /> </strong></li> </ul> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p><em>HST additional</em></p> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'></div> </div> </div> </div> "
      }
    ],
