  {
    "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/category/uncategorized/event_242706_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/pachamama/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/1200x675.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pachamama"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='movie-details-expander'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='ipc-metadata-list-item__content-container'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base sc-ac2b5e16-0 deDizX' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='cpx-bottomMargin-lg'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_container__ftjgX'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_detailsContainer__2seki'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_ctaAndDetails__BpCFb'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_genreContainer__qEtwh MovieSelectedDetails_movieDetail__8XtgT'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <p>Ten-year-old Teplupai has always wanted to be a spiritual leader, but nobody will take him seriously. When a tax collector takes away his village’s sacred treasure, he sets off on a quest to find and reclaim it. However, when he arrives in the big city, his world is forever changed as he witnesses the first arrival of Europeans to the continent, and the devastation that follows.</p> <p>This beautifully animated adventure set hundreds of years ago in the Andean region is a thrilling and moving story that has resonated with young audiences around the world, and was nominated for a César award for Best Animated Film.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <ul> <li><strong>Cast: </strong>Anne-Élisabeth Bossé, Gabrielle Côté, France Castel</li> <li><strong><strong>Director: </strong></strong>Juan Antin</li> <li><strong><strong>Writers: </strong></strong>Gabrielle Côté</li> </ul> <p><strong>Genre:</strong> Action/Adventure, Animation, Family<br /> <strong>Duration:</strong> 1<span class='cpx-body' data-testid='movie-length'>h 12m</span><br /> <strong>Rating:</strong> PG</p> <h3 style='text-align: center;'><strong>FREE! GENERAL SEATING AT THE DOOR</strong></h3> <p><img class='size-medium wp-image-242705 aligncenter' src='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/canfilmday-social-sharer-300x158.webp' alt='' width='300' height='158' /></p> <ul class='p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested' data-stringify-type='ordered-list' data-list-tree='true' data-indent='0' data-border='0'> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em> Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> <p><iframe title='Pachamama | Official Netflix Trailer' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/cOJ5BA5ZQs0?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> "
