tps://www.facebook.com/Imagine-Sound-Studio-528602073824218/?__cft__[0]=AZZiiVQRq1ulQsZbLA2uqxGptWwhMrJmf3MwUjsoKjKooBJ6nY0no7tIkhvGSbVN7ncSWCJERSh_uSoBdyg79odRIWjZ9mM7VK97BuJNgMr5siJXTdNhiOQRYPtgSKffuhjxOJYW5emRK1QiXbq3sdYEdoilqPs2zT2sWxaevpL1T79ifmbRJju7kALZwoCZi40vYvo8JSxGa5c97q2_n1xe&amp;__tn__=kK-y-R'><span class='xt0psk2'><span class='xjp7ctv'>Imagine Sound Studio</span></span></a></span>’s keyboard master <strong>Mark Camilleri </strong>from <span class='html-span xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs'><a class='x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj x1fey0fg x1s688f' tabindex='0' role='link' href='https://www.facebook.com/tenorsmusic?__cft__[0]=AZZiiVQRq1ulQsZbLA2uqxGptWwhMrJmf3MwUjsoKjKooBJ6nY0no7tIkhvGSbVN7ncSWCJERSh_uSoBdyg79odRIWjZ9mM7VK97BuJNgMr5siJXTdNhiOQRYPtgSKffuhjxOJYW5emRK1QiXbq3sdYEdoilqPs2zT2sWxaevpL1T79ifmbRJju7kALZwoCZi40vYvo8JSxGa5c97q2_n1xe&amp;__tn__=-]K-y-R'><span class='xt0psk2'><span class='xjp7ctv'>The Tenors</span></span></a></span> go for a wild ride, a fast-paced, multi-instrumental thrill-ride of jazz, ragtime, Latin, klezmer, Celtic, bebop, blues and more!</h5> <p><strong>Colin Maier (oboe, saw, vocals, from Quartetto Gelato) &amp; Mark Camilleri (pianist and music director for The Tenors) are <i>JoyRide</i>.</strong> Their mastery and versatility in a smorgasbord of styles has Colin switching gears between oboe, voice, pennywhistle and even the musical saw  in a high-energy romp that shows off their taste for fun.</p> <p>From “<em>Minnie the Moocher</em>”, to “<em>Air on a Blue String</em>” (a nod to JS Bach), to Chick Corea’s “<em>Spain</em>” and Piazzolla’s heartrending “<em>Tanti Anni Prima</em>”, they pepper their show with hilarious anecdotes and have a blast playing “Stump the Chump” where Mark creates a new song on the spot from random notes provided by members of the audience.</p> <p>“<em>Ridiculous, virtuosic, outside-the-box fun … It takes a lot of nerve to make music as amusing as JoyRide</em>” &#8212; (New York Music Daily)</p> <p>“<em>The audience was enthralled and dizzy with these supermen of music!</em>” &#8212; Eden Mills Community Club.</p> <p>Whether you’re a jazz fan, a classical fan, or a true musical adventurer, you’re guaranteed to enjoy these two virtuosos taking the wheel.  Hit the gas to catch Joyride!</p> <p><strong>TICKETS: </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>$35 Adults</strong></li> <li><strong>$15 Youth<br /> </strong></li> </ul> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p><em>HST additional</em></p> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p><iframe title='JoyRide live demo 2025' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/yyTP2HnGCqo?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> "
      }
    ],
